using box.transform
using box.geometry
using box.portal

// The portal-room description of the compound: VisArea per room, VisPortal per opening,
// VisOccluder per blocker and a PortalDoor (etc/scenes/portal/door.flecs) on the portal of each
// door. A view draws only the rooms its camera sees through open portals, and a door opens for
// the camera.
// The Position places the rooms with their portals, so a WorldOrigin shift moves both.
